# The repository root is the web root, so anything left here is downloadable.
# These were all being served: the full-site zip, the Cloud Functions source,
# the Firestore rules, and REOPEN-PORTALS.md — which lists the site's remaining
# weaknesses. Keep this list in step with anything new that is not a public page.

# Notes and documentation
*.md

# Firebase config, rules and functions (deployed separately, never over HTTP)
firebase.json
.firebaserc
firestore.rules
storage.rules
firestore.indexes.json
functions/

# Tooling and build leftovers. package.json is deliberately NOT listed: it
# already 404s, and hiding it could change how Vercel detects this project.
node_modules/
*.zip
.claude/
.github/
scratchpad/
